@zhenggen-xu can you get someone to help @aravindmani-1. It appears that in this particular case, because Ethernet0 is seemingly unchanged, so it was NOT removed in running configuration, as result, the new ports cannot be added.

Ports to be deleted : 
 {
    "Ethernet0": "100000"
}
Ports to be added : 
 {
    "Ethernet0": "100000",
    "Ethernet2": "100000",
    "Ethernet4": "100000",
    "Ethernet6": "100000"
}

@aravindmani-1  As mentioned before,  the issue seemed to be here:  https://github.com/sonic-net/sonic-utilities/blob/4a3d49d359f787cae896d65fa882fbaaac6e57f2/config/main.py#L4146 ,  can you remove the below a few lines of code for optimization and try,  while new logic implementing is not available yet? 

```
    for item in matched_items:
        del_intf_dict.pop(item)
        add_intf_dict.pop(item)
```
